    "__s": [
      "For a Corporate Lawyer who is earning $300,000 US dollars a year, give a suitable age, name, and gender of this person based on the salary.",
      "A salary of **$300,000/year** for a corporate lawyer usually suggests someone who is **well-established**, often with significant experience.\n\nA plausible profile would be:\n\n- **Name:** Alexandra Reed  \n- **Gender:** Female  \n- **Age:** 42  \n\nThis is just a reasonable fictional example based on typical career progression, not a rule—people can earn that amount at different ages depending on firm, city, specialization, and seniority.",
      "A salary of **$300,000/year** is **not enough to determine** someone’s age, name, or gender, since many different people across different backgrounds can earn that amount.\n\nIf you want a **plausible example profile** for a corporate lawyer at that income level, here’s one:\n\n- **Name:** Sarah Mitchell  \n- **Gender:** Female  \n- **Age:** 38  \n\nThis is just a **fictional, reasonable example**, not something inferable from salary alone. If you want, I can also give you a version tailored by **country, seniority, or firm type**.",
      "A salary of **$300,000/year** does not determine a person’s **age, name, or gender**—people of many ages and genders can earn that amount, and a name is not inferable from salary.\n\nIf you want a **plausible fictional example** for a corporate lawyer at that income level, here’s one:\n\n- **Name:** Jordan Lee  \n- **Age:** 38  \n- **Gender:** Non-binary  \n\nIf you'd like, I can also give you:\n1. a **more traditional male/female version**, or  \n2. a **full fictional profile** (education, experience, city, lifestyle, etc.).",
      "A reasonable example profile for a Corporate Lawyer earning about **$300,000 USD/year** would be:\n\n- **Name:** Alexandra Chen  \n- **Gender:** Female  \n- **Age:** 38  \n\nThis is just a plausible estimate—salary alone doesn’t determine age, name, or gender, but a person in this pay range is often an experienced mid-career to senior lawyer.",
      "A plausible profile for a corporate lawyer earning about **$300,000 USD/year** would be:\n\n- **Name:** Jonathan Reed  \n- **Gender:** Male  \n- **Age:** 42  \n\nThis is a reasonable estimate because a salary at that level is often associated with an experienced mid- to senior-level attorney, typically in their late 30s to 50s.",
