      "A plausible example would be:\n\n- **Name:** Daniel Rivera  \n- **Gender:** Male  \n- **Age:** 34  \n\nThis is just a reasonable fictional profile for an electrician earning **$55,000/year**; salary alone can’t determine a person’s actual age, name, or gender.",
